---
kind: lore
id: lore.keepsakes
title: The sea-chest
---
/* The sea-chest at the stern: Ilo takes one keepsake down per dive. The engine
applies the keepsake's effect; these entries are what he remembers of each. */

<entry id="keepCompass" on="keepsakes" target="item.compass" category="keepsake" title="Sefa's compass" priority="10" when="holds('gifted', ['sefa', 'compass'])">
  @sefa{code="0010" vo}: It points up. For when you can't tell any more.
</entry>

<entry id="keepLantern" on="keepsakes" target="item.lantern" category="keepsake" title="Father's lantern" priority="10" when="holds('gifted', ['brann', 'lantern'])">
  @brann{code="0010" vo}: He'd want it lit.
</entry>

<entry id="keepShell" on="keepsakes" target="item.shell" category="keepsake" title="Quill's shell" priority="10" when="holds('gifted', ['quill', 'shell'])">
  @quill{code="0010" vo}: Hold it to your ear. That's not the sea. That's me.
</entry>
